---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h2>Sketches</h2>
			<p>
				Foodtown - this is a sketch I wrote for my Maude team Peach in 2020. It was performed at the UBCTNY Hell’s Kitchen theater.
			</p>
			<iframe id="embed_video" class="pagelayer-video-iframe" width="100%" height="400" src="//www.youtube.com/embed/Plx-cJik2n8?&autoplay=0&mute=0&loop=0&playlist=Plx-cJik2n8" frameborder="0"></iframe>

			<p>
				Paint and Pinot - this is the first sketch I wrote for Peach. It was supposed to be featured on an industry showcase show put together by the UCB on March 12, 2020 (the night the theater shut down - Sad!)
			</p>
			<iframe id="embed_video" class="pagelayer-video-iframe" width="100%" height="400" src="//www.youtube.com/embed/sq3-b477aIM?&autoplay=0&mute=0&loop=0&playlist=sq3-b477aIM" frameborder="0"></iframe>

			<p>
				I Am the Most New York - this is a music video I directed and edited for <a href="https://www.amillionshetlandponies.com/">A Million Shetland Ponies</a>. It's a Gregorian Chant song about the greatest city on Earth.
			</p>
			<iframe id="embed_video" class="pagelayer-video-iframe" width="100%" height="400" src="//www.youtube.com/embed/REvZeGL6M-U?&autoplay=0&mute=0&loop=0&playlist=REvZeGL6M-U" frameborder="0"></iframe>

			<p>
				Song and Dance Man - for Ponyboy. What if someone's dad at Career Day was a "Song and Dance Man"?
			</p>
			<iframe id="embed_video" class="pagelayer-video-iframe" width="100%" height="400" src="//www.youtube.com/embed/plVF1D6bINo?&autoplay=0&mute=0&loop=0&playlist=plVF1D6bINo" frameborder="0"></iframe>

			<p>
				Crocs - for Ponyboy.
			</p>
			<iframe id="embed_video" class="pagelayer-video-iframe" width="100%" height="400" src="//www.youtube.com/embed/phMU7ViAL5g?&autoplay=0&mute=0&loop=0&playlist=phMU7ViAL5g" frameborder="0"></iframe>

			<p>
				Big Chair - For Ponyboy. I love prop comedy.
			</p>
			<iframe id="embed_video" class="pagelayer-video-iframe" width="100%" height="400" src="//www.youtube.com/embed/hoYGL10ln9w?&autoplay=0&mute=0&loop=0&playlist=hoYGL10ln9w" frameborder="0"></iframe>

			<p>
				Someone Has Tipped Over My Hog - for Ponyboy. That's me as the guy with the tipped over hog.
			</p>
			<iframe id="embed_video" class="pagelayer-video-iframe" width="100%" height="400" src="//www.youtube.com/embed/kUkp6UXipxQ?&autoplay=0&mute=0&loop=0&playlist=kUkp6UXipxQ" frameborder="0"></iframe>

			<p>
				Alone - Bushcraft GameCube - a little video I made in Prospect Park.
			</p>
			<iframe id="embed_video" class="pagelayer-video-iframe" width="100%" height="400" src="//www.youtube.com/embed/FiKxZD02lkc?&autoplay=0&mute=0&loop=0&playlist=FiKxZD02lkc" frameborder="0"></iframe>

			<iframe id="embed_video" class="pagelayer-video-iframe" width="100%" height="400" src="//www.youtube.com/embed/QM42_K4utxE?&autoplay=0&mute=0&loop=0&playlist=QM42_K4utxE" frameborder="0"></iframe>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
